#### Now that you’ve used HTML, CSS, and AI to modify a website, it’s time to build one!

#### Think back to the four parts of the site from the last level:

- #### **Navigation bar-** Links to main pages

- #### **Hero-** Main attention-grabbing section

- #### **Cards-** Grouped content previews

- #### **Footer-** Info and links at page bottom


